<bblocks://ogc.bioclima.ebv.vap-coniferous> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "VAP Coniferous Finland 2001-2018" ;
    dct:abstract "Concrete EBV dataset: yearly maps of the start of the Vegetation Active Period in coniferous forests of Finland, 2001-2018, derived from MODIS Fractional Snow Cover. The CoverageJSON file is stored in this block's examples/ directory."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
