<bblocks://ogc.bioclima.indicator.pci> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "Phenological Change Indicator (PCI)" ;
    dct:abstract "Rate of change of vegetation active period onset, computed as the weighted mean of per-pixel linear trends for coniferous and deciduous forests over the analysis window. Includes the Python implementation in code/compute.py and an example output for Finland 2001-2018."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
